+			-- P-Q110 (a) prototype: `force` covers the install run ONLY. A request made during it (fn Set
+			-- its own dep, or called self:Rerun()) is an ordinary request on a not-yet-executable handle
+			-- → HOLD it (the cleanup fn just returned stays stored; the replay at bind consumes it).
+			if force and self._pending and not module.Backend.canExecute(self) then
